{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Include hypermobility awareness and inclusive PE in the school curricula",
        "additional_details": "We want this to help teach children about hypermobility and how it can affect the body, and to educate teachers so they can better understand and support hypermobile pupils. We call on the Government to make PE more inclusive by helping schools adapt activities appropriately when needed.",
        "background": "We call on the UK Government to include hypermobility awareness within school curricula, particularly physical education.",
